#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is a collection?"
msgstr "什么是收藏品吗?"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/what_is.rst:7
msgid ""
"A title block collection is a database where all title block files are "
"stored and classified."
msgstr "图框集合是一个数据库，所有图框文件都在这里存储和分类。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/what_is.rst:10
msgid ""
"QElectroTech has two different title block collections integrated, `QET "
"collection`_ and `User collection`_. The title block collections can be "
"found at `projects panel`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech有两个不同的图框集集集集，`QET集 <QET collection_>`_ 和 `用户集 <User "
"collection_>`_。图框集可以在 `项目面板 <projects panel_>`_ 找到。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/what_is.rst:16
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech projects panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目小组"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/collection/what_is.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech displays also a third collection when a `project`_ is opened, "
"the `project collection`_. This collection is not part from the software "
"structure and it is managed automatically by QElectroTech during the folio "
"title block definition."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 当一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 打开时， `项目收集 <project "
"collection_>`_。此收藏不是软件结构的一部分，而是在folio图框定义期间由 QElectroTech 自动管理。"
